{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中方指，菲律賓公務船侵闖中國黃岩島管轄海域。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PHIL-1300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026kzXOSnfaAE1784783999.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.PHIL-1300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國海警局發言人稱，兩艘菲律賓公務船周四不顧中方一再勸阻和警告，執意侵闖黃岩島海域。中國海警依法採取跟監外迫，攔阻管制等必要措施予以驅離。現場操作專業規範、正當合法。海警局強調黃岩島是中國固有領土，敦促菲方立即停止侵權挑釁，中國海警將依法持續在黃岩島海域維權執法，堅決維護國家領土主權和海洋權益。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PHIL-1300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026WQSv3cgr7q1784783989.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.PHIL-1300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中菲日前在南海仁愛礁發生衝突。外長王毅昨天在馬尼拉會見菲律賓外長拉扎羅時，強烈抗議菲方人員衝撞中方執法船隻的粗暴行徑。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T05:38:06.979553+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}